                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "PLAYED THE REDUX VERSION. But I can't leave a review there, so I will put it here.\n____________________________________________\n\nYes, but with a HUGE caveat. This game is not really \"fun\" to play. A lot of these puzzles are not intuitive. I wanted to beat this game as I had it in my library for so long and the last time I played it, I had a game breaking bug. \n\nIf I could rate this an average game, I would. But I can tell the developers poured their hearts into this and that is why I gave it a thumbs up. Plus, I like the environments and buildings, even if it's easy to get lost in some areas. \n",
